      "created_at": "2019-11-19T11:30:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint at 5 / 0 / 9 / 18. Sold out for damage with the exception of a turn 2 Shielding Winds, and got Blade to flip after only two rounds. When he flipped, I used Into the Stratosphere to help reduce our incoming damage in multiple respects,&nbsp;Reclaim From the Deep to get back some high damage stuff, and Ground Pound because it was Ground Pound. Blade's flip side never had a chance to get rolling.</p>",
